-- two files open, the second on top --
  tabs: ["main.bas","a.bas"]  on top: 1
switching to the first tab through the tab widget itself
  action=select, active: main.bas
typing into it
  tabs: ["* main.bas","a.bas"]
Save, from the toolbar
  action=saved, tabs: ["main.bas","a.bas"]
  on disk: print "edited"/
Reload
  action=refreshed, tabs: ["main.bas","a.bas"]
New Folder, with the field empty
  action=created
  0 Workspace: workspace
  0 ● qtview_edit_proj
  1 ▸ docs
  1 ▾ src
  2 ▸ new-folder-1
  2   a.bas
  2   b.bas
  1   README.md
  1   main.bas
